{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st10",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_09",
  "title": "Deck Room",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-10",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st10.txt",
  "sourceHash": "75daf155a1edf2c6fa47474a9581a60398d389fcc4c8520c2073e171c17387c9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You wasted your chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If I were you, when I caught that talking Seaborn in Sal Viento, I would've forced it to spill everything it knew about Ægir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've been walking the land for years. You've never heard Ægir's messages. But the ocean is different. The ocean has never been disconnected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yet you simply allowed it to die without creating any value. An unproductive decision, Gladiia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't need to hear messages from trash. The only answers our prey can provide are the grunts of lowly beasts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seems you've found some assistants on land. And put quite a bit of trust in them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Last Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_448_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Howls) The cosmos... cemetery..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're showing mercy. Why does he still stand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'm not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He's just a little sturdier than anticipated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Last Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_448_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The knight does not fight back. He suddenly freezes in place and throws his head back. He staggers, spins around, and looks up.\nGladiia had planned to seize this moment to put an end to the chase, but right as she is about to, she has a faint premonition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Seaborn's scent. It's changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're already sensitive enough to notice such changes then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right, Gladiia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter how much you try to console yourself or others, this is a problem we'll have to deal with, sooner or later, ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Garcia!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chief Mate",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Sobbing howl)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good... Good... You hurt it real bad! We'll track it down in no time by following these blood trails."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, what are these burn marks? What did it do to my ship?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "The monster can't have left these marks behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. It must be the masterwork of our lovely little Iberian bird. Aw, they grow up so fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So who's scarier? The Seaborn or her people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...You mean the Iberian from before? Her? Impossible. Any of this ship's battle-hardened sailors would've been stronger than her. How could SHE do this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chief Mate",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Nibbles on the captain's sleeves)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No matter. Regardless of what that Iberian did, we have to hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Time to put an end to this months-long hunt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You seem to be in a pretty good mood, Mister Captain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good mood? Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who wouldn't be happy to bring an end to such a long hunt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You keep chasing. I'll go a different way. It won't cut through these walls, it'll try to get closer to the sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain Alfonso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_446_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Garcia... Your wounds aren't life-threatening. Just hang in there, and we'll be right back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chief Mate",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_452_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The injured chief mate still needs more time to recover. It looks at its captain's face in silence.\nJoy. A hard-to-disguise excitement. A vigor it has not felt in a long time.\nIt takes a peaceful nap, focusing its energy on rejuvenating its injured parts. All to help its lover continue the hunt."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A brief, light dream. Short, trance-like, and extremely rare since its body underwent such profound changes.\nIn its dream, it stands upon Iberia's shores. The sky booms with fireworks and hums with the din of whistles. A high-spirited Alfonso stands at its side, asking it a question.\nGarcia.\nSee those kids along the shore? We all like children.\nChildren are the future of Iberia. Our glory, our feats, and our skills all die with us.\nBut children. New lives. Ones that all of Iberia will come together to nurture. And they'll inherit it all.\nGarcia.\nWho do you think he should take after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(How can it still move so fast with those injuries? I can't keep up!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(And... holding back from firing my handcannon is...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The nethersea brand has spread to the ship? But how?! It wasn't this bad a little while ago!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fluorescing nethersea brand has devoured the golden Iberian hall.\nThe intricate dome reflects a ghastly blue light. And amidst the glow stands a lone, out-of-place woman.\nHer two hands are crossed in front of her as she silently and carefully sizes up the throne in front of her. The nethersea brand spreads from beneath her feet, sapping the very color from the golden floor.\nShe turns her head. Her eyes hold nothing but compassion and expectation."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Good evening, Irene."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(A Church of the Deep cultist!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did I miss...?! No, there's no way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Originium Arts?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right, Irene. If Dario could see you now, I'm sure he'd be so proud."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—How do you know our names? Who are you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am a translator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You think a lie like that will do you any good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never lie, Irene. I've translated a great many works. Perhaps one of novels full of Gaulish critical realism on your shelves contains my touch? Have you ever even noted the name of the translator?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at your feet! You're the one who brought the nethersea brand?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's a somewhat biased statement. I did not bring the brand. Rather, I established a bond with the fluorescent sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Truly, it is an honor to be a part of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How did you get to this ship?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That doesn't matter, Irene."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nor does it matter whether you can defeat the Seaborn, whether I die here, or whether this ship will be key to reconnecting with Ægir. None of that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And yes... The sacrifices of Dario and the Penal Battalion, Gran Faro's collapse, the Eye of Iberia. The long, long time that has passed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the vast process of evolutionary transformation, all of these are but drops of water in the sea of life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My respect comes from the fact that we are all but a part of the Cycle. Compared to the whole, we are all insignificant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Wait. You mentioned the High Inquisitor. What happened to him...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alas, poor Irene. Look, I know the feeling of having questions and needing answers, but is this really the time? When your enemy stands right before you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened to him?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "His sacrifice was in vain, Irene."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sea breeze brought me news of his death. You have my condolences."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Impossible... It can't be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing is impossible, Irene."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When the oracle descended, all the futures of this land were set in stone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are bugs crawling along the ground. We ought to follow the ordained path. What's wrong with choosing a life without barriers, without separation, without country and without form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you choose to cease resisting, all the better. If not—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—If none of this really matters, Amaia, then why are you buying time for our wounded little prey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've woken up, Laurentina."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not completely, but I can at least remember your name. Hope I'm not coming across as rude."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Irene!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "What did you do to her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing. We were only making small talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Skadi, continue the chase."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Wasn't it your prey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who was it that let me run into such a nostalgic figure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "...Alright, be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#6",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Irene?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...You're lying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The breath of the sea does not lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, like I said, that's impossible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The High Inquisitor's death must have had a purpose. The Inquisition never makes sacrifices in vain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you don't believe that, cultist, then... I'll just have to become that purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So be it. What a resilient child you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hunter, let's go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, my dear little Irene, you've only just learned to control the power of an Inquisition handcannon, and this is how you display it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you continue trying to burn the nethersea brand in such a crude manner, Captain Alfonso will be furious, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well... no matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're going to just let them walk away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alas, unlike Quintus, I am not in such a hurry. Why would I want to face two Hunters at once and cut my life even shorter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there a difference between a moment and an instant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There isn't, but seeing you revert to your old temperament sure brings me back, Laurentina. After all, you were in a coma until the first experiment began."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How have you been since you left us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Specter's lips curl into a subtle smile.\nIt is the most beautiful smile she's shown tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "It's getting faster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've already... *pant*... put two more holes in it. Just how much blood can it have in there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Two? How did you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll tell you later. I don't think my stamina is going to last much longer—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—It's been cannibalizing its own kind this whole time! No wonder!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Watch out, it's coming at us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "—Urgh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla, where is He?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Answer. I wish to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You monster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Before Irene can fire her handcannon, the Seaborn lurches forward.\nAs the wall cracks audibly, Skadi leaps back with tremendous force, before closing the gap between her and the Seaborn almost instantly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her lethal strikes once again bite down on thin air."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "What...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(None of her hits landed?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Insufficient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nutrients. Time. All insufficient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla, we require answers. But, I can feel His presence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With words, we shall implore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla, even if He does not answer, it does not mean, He is not there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even if He is not there, it does not mean, that our kind, has lost its way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our kind, has found its way. We will, seize our own fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Survival, the primary goal."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Do all of you love rambling on while trying to kill us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Don't overthink this, and don't plan on returning to the ocean either!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Insufficient, far from enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Ugh—! Cover your ears! Irene!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Ah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seaborn",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_456_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Screeching howl) —!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Last Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_448_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Rasping murmur) —Roci—nante—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rocinante",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_463_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Brays)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "The Last Knight",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_448_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The waves are coming. We wait for them. We will wait outside. With weapons, we tear them— Let us go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rocinante",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_463_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Echoing braying)"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Seaborn's murmurs can be heard from afar. Gladiia frowns slightly.\nFor an ordinary land-walker to recklessly make contact with the ocean and win eternal madness is certainly conceivable.\nBut what of the other Seaborn that obeyed him?\nBut Gladiia does not think about it too deeply. Because a nauseating premonition is gnawing at her nerves—\n—It makes her neck itch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's happening up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This ship has been adrift at sea for more than sixty years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If they'd wanted to do away with it, or even simply treated it and its crew as enemies, the Stultifera Navis would've sunk long ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...So instead, they're assimilating it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They've treated the ship as a part of their environment. For whatever reason, they must've allowed it to survive in their waters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now, the situation has changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You mean..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The nethersea brand? Since when? And how did it spread this quickly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This ship will most certainly sink."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gladiia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you ever considered why an Ægir as talented as Breogan chose, in his final hour, to design the key the way he did?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It should've unlocked the secrets Ægir has long dreamed of. It is the quintessence of his life's work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So why is just anyone's blood enough to activate it? Why would he let it fall into the hands of a frail knight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We did silence that thing. But they probably don't need any gods at all. Only humanity, in their impotence and hypocrisy, would fold their hands together and pray to the ocean, finding far too much solace within it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to make use of what little time we have, Gladiia."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "You're still thinking about the incident with Thiago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm, not quite. Of all the tragedies I've endured, his is hardly worth mentioning. Nothing more than a grain of sand on the beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But how much sand does this beach require?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This ship wasn't brought by the Penal Battalion. Most of the town's vessels were brought under their supervision, and the few that weren't were... forgotten, stranded along the shore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Then we've saved quite a bit of time thanks to someone's carelessness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't help but think of how much more will be forgotten, what else will be stranded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit, if the land of Terra were a ship, what kind of vessel do you think it would be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "We're almost at the Eye of Iberia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...That we are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "aliases": [
        "Kal'tsit"
      ],
